┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    DSA TECHNIQUES IN TRADING                        │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                    │
│  TECHNIQUE          BEST FOR                       COMPLEXITY     │
│  ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────│
│  Two Pointer        Trend Detection, Patterns      O(n) ✅        │
│  Sliding Window     Moving Averages, Pivots        O(n) ✅        │
│  Hash Maps          Pattern Frequency, Volume      O(n) ✅        │
│  Binary Search      Find Support/Resistance        O(log n) ✅    │
│  Recursion/DFS      Fibonacci, Complex Patterns    O(2^n) ⚠️      │
│  Dynamic Program     Optimal Entry/Exit            O(n²) ⚠️       │
│  Trees/Heaps        Order Book, Priority          O(log n) ✅     │
│  Graphs             Correlation Networks          O(V+E) ⚠️       │
│  Sorting            Volume Analysis               O(n log n) ✅   │
│  Greedy             Quick Profit Taking           O(n) ✅         │
│                                                                    │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

Technique         	  Best Use Case	               When to AVOID
Two Pointer	      Simple trends, patterns	         Complex optimization
Sliding Window	  Moving averages, pivots	         Finding optimal points
Hash Maps	        Frequency, duplicates	           Ordering/ranking
Binary Search	    Finding specific values	         Pattern detection
Recursion	        Exploring all possibilities	     Large datasets
DP	              Optimization problems	           Very large datasets
Heap	            Priority/order operations	       Simple lookups
Graph	            Relationships, networks	         Single stocks
Sorting	          Ranking, top k	                 Real-time updates
Greedy	          Quick decisions	                 Optimal solutions
